@startuml
title HIP-3 — the life of a builder-deployed perp DEX
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #4A78B5

start
:stake 500k HYPE;
:deploy the perp dex
and pick a collateral asset;
note right
  The stake is committed for at
  least 183 days and stays
  slashable through the 7-day
  unstaking queue
end note
if (fewer than 3 assets deployed so far?) then (yes)
  :registerAsset2 with no auction;
else (no)
  :win the shared HIP-3 Dutch auction,
  or spend one of the
  7 + 0.2 x n reserve deployments;
endif
:configure the market
setOracle, setFundingMultipliers,
setMarginTableIds, setOpenInterestCaps,
setDeployerFees (scale 0-300%);
if (enable cross margin on the asset?) then (yes)
  :cross margin enabled;<<#FDEEEE>>
  note right
    IRREVERSIBLE. Validators review
    the deployer whenever externalPerpPx
    moves more than 50% from the
    start-of-day price
  end note
else (no)
  :isolated or no-cross only;
endif
repeat
  :operate: publish oracle prices
  every few seconds, keep the book
  and the margin table sane;
  if (irregular deployer input?) then (yes)
    :stake-weighted validator vote;<<#FDEEEE>>
    :slash up to 100 / 50 / 20% by impact,
    burned rather than paid to users;<<#FDEEEE>>
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (market still listed?) is (yes)
->no;
:haltTrading settles positions
to the current mark price;
note right
  Reversible, so the same asset
  can be recycled for the next
  dated contract without a
  new auction
end note
if (all assets settled and 183 days elapsed?) then (yes)
  :stake is free to unstake;
else (no)
  :stake stays locked;
endif
stop
@enduml
